From be206ca4541c73899edc63375844aa082edf033f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: blame42 <346530647+git-blame-42@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 16:00:58 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Restrict event edit and removal to its owner

Edit, update and destroy look the event up through the logged admin's events, so another admin's event falls into the existing not-found flow. Show stays open to every admin. The list and show pages hide Edit/Remove for events the admin does not own, and the populate adds a second admin owning the last two events.
---
